n all 8 Mastery sets (10/10 cases)\n    (\"evtx\", \"record_count\"): _v(\"evtx:record_count\", 24),\n    # D25: the ROOT nk cell's name (base block root cell offset @0x24 -> 0x1000 + off), not the base-block file name --\n    # \"HuntressArtifactAssemblyLine\" single, random names TT and all Mastery sets\n    (\"registry\", \"hive_root_name\"): _v(\"registry:hive_root_name\", 25),\n    # D26: SCCA header executable name (UTF-16LE @0x10, 60 bytes, NUL-terminated) after MAM\\x04 Xpress-Huffman\n    # decompression -- prebuilt prefetch.pf_value promoted via prefetch.py: \"CMD.EXE\" single, TT and 10/10 Mastery\n    (\"prefetch\", \"executable_name\"): _v(\"prefetch:executable_name\", 26),\n    # D27: classic pcap complete packet records (16-byte record headers walked from @24, truncated tail not counted) --\n    # prebuilt pcap.pcap_value promoted via pcap.py: 3 single, 32 TT, 17..39 on 11/11 Mastery sets\n    (\"pcap\", \"packet_count\"): _v(\"pcap:packet_count\", 27),\n    # D28: raw disk image partition StartingLBAs in table order (GPT entry array, else MBR primaries + EBR chain),\n    # compact JSON int list -- [34] single, [60,93,148] TT, 12/12 Mastery sets\n    (\"disk\", \"partition_start_lba_sequence\"): _v(\"disk:partition_start_lba_sequence\", 28),\n    # D30: cluster zip members (minus delivery-manifest.json) grouped by real-bytes SHA-256, groups >= 2, each the\n    # sorted manifest artifact ids, groups sorted -> compact JSON (single, TT, 14/14 Mastery sets)\n    (\"relation\", \"identical_sha256_groups\"): _v(\"relation:identical_sha256_groups\", 30),\n}\n\n\"\"\"X.509 certificate fields (prebuilt, SPECULATIVE). fmt `x509`, alias `cert`.\n\nInput = one certificate member: DER (SEQUENCE 30 82 ..), or PEM text ('-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----' / 'X509 CERTIFICATE'\n/ 'TRUSTED CERTIFICATE'; the FIRST block of a bundle), or a degenerate PKCS#7 bundle (.p7b/.p7c, DER or PEM 'PKCS7')\n-> its first certificate. Parsed with asn1crypto (the same DER walker as the pe.